]}, {"id": "f65ad04", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "isInner": false, "settings": {"title": "Exam Prep Review Class", "header_size": "h1", "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=white"}, "typography_typography": "custom", "typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 56, "sizes": []}, "typography_font_size_mobile": {"unit": "px", "size": 36, "sizes": []}, "_css_classes": "g-ph1"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "08be2de", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "isInner": false, "settings": {"editor": "<p>The traditional Conditioned Air license Exam Prep Review Class, designed to help you pass the exam on your first attempt.</p>", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=lead", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=line"}, "_css_classes": "g-plead"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "30671d5", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "isInner": false, "settings": {"html": "<ul class=\"g-facts\"><li><span class=\"g-facts__ico\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"/><path d=\"M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11\"/></svg></span><span><b>After Board approval</b>buy this once you are approved to sit for the exam</span></li><li><span class=\"g-facts__ico\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2H20v20H6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5H20\"/></svg></span><span><b>All Reference Books</b>except Manuals D &amp; J, covered in Residential Design</span></li><li><span class=\"g-facts__ico\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2\"/><path d=\"M15 18H9\"/><path d=\"M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14\"/><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"/><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"/></svg></span><span><b>Printed Study Guide</b>shipped to you by UPS</span></li></ul>"}, "elements": []}]}]}, {"id": "bbea3ba", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "boxed", "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"column": "40", "row": "40", "isLinked": true, "unit": "px", "size": 40}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "104", "right": "64", "bottom": "104", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1312, "sizes": []}, "flex_gap_mobile": {"column": "28", "row": "28", "isLinked": true, "unit": "px", "size": 28}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "40", "bottom": "80", "left": "40", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "64", "right": "20", "bottom": "64", "left": "20", "isLinked": false}, "html_tag": "section"}, "elements": [{"id": "469e53b", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"column": "64", "row": "64", "isLinked": true, "unit": "px", "size": 64}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "flex_gap_tablet": {"column": "40", "row": "40", "isLinked": true, "unit": "px", "size": 40}, "flex_gap_mobile": {"column": "32", "row": "32", "isLinked": true, "unit": "px", "size": 32}, "css_classes": "g-twocol"}, "elements": [{"id": "f49e1a7", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"column": "40", "row": "40", "isLinked": true, "unit": "px", "size": 40}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "flex_gap_mobile": {"column": "32", "row": "32", "isLinked": true, "unit": "px", "size": 32}, "css_classes": "g-main"}, "elements": [{"id": "f8ba7c6", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "isInner": false, "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"g-callout g-callout--warn\"><span class=\"g-callout__ico\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 16v-4M12 8h.01\"/></svg></span><div><p class=\"g-callout__t\">Before you buy</p><p>You should already be approved by the Conditioned Air Licensing Board before you purchase this class. If you have not already, buy the <a href=\"https://staging158.dreamweb.digital/license-classes/reference-tabs/\">Permanent Reference TABs</a> for the Conditioned Air Reference Books.</p></div></div>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "55b5ffd", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"column": "16", "row": "16", "isLinked": true, "unit": "px", "size": 16}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "569759e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "isInner": false, "settings": {"title": "Who it is for", "header_size": "h2", "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=navy", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=h2"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "d5ca7b0", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "isInner": false, "settings": {"editor": "<p>You should already have taken the Residential Design Class, which is a good portion of the exam. If you did not, because you went to a vocational tech school (where the class is not taught as exam prep) and submitted your diploma or transcripts, consider taking the <a href=\"https://staging158.dreamweb.digital/license-classes/residential-design/\">Residential Design Class</a> as well.</p><ul class=\"g-list\"><li>This class covers both Restricted and Non-Restricted applicants.</li><li>It is required if you fail the exam twice, and highly recommended before that:</li></ul><ul class=\"g-list g-list--sub\"><li>To save personal study time by knowing what to study, and how to tab and highlight your books.</li><li>To be better prepared and confident, reducing the fear of taking the exam.</li><li>To save the expense and time of re-applying and studying again to re-take the exam.</li></ul>", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=body", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=ink"}, "_css_classes": "g-prose "}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "49c3991", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"column": "16", "row": "16", "isLinked": true, "unit": "px", "size": 16}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "a646057", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "isInner": false, "settings": {"title": "GLEC Exam Prep Study Guide", "header_size": "h2", "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=navy", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=h2"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "9b8133d", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "isInner": false, "settings": {"editor": "<p>When you buy this class, we ship you the complete Exam Prep Study Guide by UPS. It has 10 tabs and about 150 pages, with exam-type questions from each non-design book and full solutions, not just the answers.</p><ul class=\"g-list\"><li>Sample practice test questions and working examples for gas pipe and flue vent sizing, conduit and wire sizing, psychrometrics, and accounting principles</li><li>Study skills, test-taking skills and question tracking</li><li>The significance and importance of each Reference Book</li></ul>", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=body", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=ink"}, "_css_classes": "g-prose "}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "e29ce3b", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"column": "20", "row": "20", "isLinked": true, "unit": "px", "size": 20}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "a35899a", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "isInner": false, "settings": {"title": "The three parts of the class", "header_size": "h2", "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=navy", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=h2"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "b859dc3", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "isInner": false, "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"g-parts\"><div class=\"g-part\"><span class=\"g-part__k\">Part A</span><h3>Highlighting and tabbing videos</h3><ul class=\"g-list\"><li>12.6 hours for Non-Restricted students (you already did the Carrier books)</li><li>15.6 hours for Restricted students (includes the Carrier design books)</li><li>The tabbing, overview and highlighting of the Reference Books, at home or work, at your own pace</li><li>A visual and audio explanation of the materials, charts, tables and equations</li><li>Optional Certificate of Completion once you highlight all the non-design Reference Books</li></ul></div><div class=\"g-part\"><span class=\"g-part__k\">Part B</span><h3>Working examples, about 7.5 hours</h3><ul class=\"g-list\"><li>IFGC: gas pipe and flue vent sizing</li><li>IMC: book examples that calculate fresh air intake CFM</li><li>NEC: conduit and wire sizing, and calculating amps to size disconnects and fuses</li><li>Psychrometrics, with a psych chart in the back sleeve of the binder</li><li>NASCLA: accounting principles</li><li>Study skills, test-taking skills and question tracking</li><li>Worksheets are in the Study Guide</li></ul><p class=\"g-part__note\">You can print a certificate after completing all the calculations. Only print it if you have failed the exam twice: you would send it to the Board to take the exam a third time.</p></div><div class=\"g-part\"><span class=\"g-part__k\">Part C</span><h3>Online quizzes</h3><ul class=\"g-list\"><li>A quiz for each non-design book</li><li>Retake each quiz until you score high enough, consistently, to feel confident</li><li>Simple questions only, not calculation examples</li><li>Go through them the last week before the exam</li></ul></div></div>"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "9f5f007", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"column": "16", "row": "16", "isLinked": true, "unit": "px", "size": 16}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "f3f7641", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "isInner": false, "settings": {"title": "Good to know", "header_size": "h2", "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=navy", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=h2"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "02d1e5e", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "isInner": false, "settings": {"editor": "<ul class=\"g-list\"><li>Can be used for NATE CEHs. Submit your certificate to NATE upon renewal.</li><li>For the online portions, print your certificate online after you finish watching all the videos.</li></ul>", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=body", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=ink"}, "_css_classes": "g-prose "}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "805e062", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "isInner": false, "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"g-callout g-callout--info\"><span class=\"g-callout__ico\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 16v-4M12 8h.01\"/></svg></span><div><p class=\"g-callout__t\">Access</p><p>Available on demand, 24/7, as many times as you like: up to one year after the date you buy the class, or until you pass your exam, whichever comes first. Access can be extended if needed for a fair fee, based on how long it has been since you bought it.</p></div></div>"}, "elements": []}]}, {"id": "06cbc2f", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"column": "0", "row": "0", "isLinked": true, "unit": "px", "size": 0}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "css_classes": "g-aside"}, "elements": [{"id": "93070d8", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"column": "16", "row": "16", "isLinked": true, "unit": "px", "size": 16}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "28", "right": "28", "bottom": "28", "left": "28", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "22", "right": "20", "bottom": "22", "left": "20", "isLinked": false}, "css_classes": "g-buy"}, "elements": [{"id": "e251308", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "isInner": false, "settings": {"html": "<span class=\"g-code\">CA-OL</span>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "cc264b7", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "isInner": false, "settings": {"title": "$", "header_size": "span", "__globals__": {}, "__dynamic__": {"title": "[elementor-tag id=\"76a1725\" name=\"woocommerce-product-price-tag\" settings=\"%7B%22product_id%22%3A%20%22540%22%2C%20%22format%22%3A%20%22original%22%7D\"]"}, "_css_classes": "g-num g-pricebig g-buy__price"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "148b57f", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "isInner": false, "settings": {"editor": "<p class=\"g-buy__note\">Restricted and Non-Restricted</p>", "__globals__": {}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "2efe27f", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "wc-add-to-cart", "isInner": false, "settings": {"product_id": "540", "text": "Add to cart", "show_quantity": "", "align": "left", "selected_icon": {"value": "", "library": ""}, "icon": "", "_css_classes": "g-atc g-atc-primary g-buy__atc"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "809048b", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "isInner": false, "settings": {"html": "<ul class=\"g-tick\"><li><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg>Printed Exam Prep Study Guide, shipped</li><li><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg>Highlighting and tabbing videos</li><li><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg>Working examples and online quizzes</li></ul>"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "8c32a41", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "html", "isInner": false, "settings": {"html": "<ul class=\"g-buy__links\"><li><a href=\"https://staging158.dreamweb.digital/license-classes/reference-tabs/\">Permanent Reference TABs</a></li><li><a href=\"https://sebookstore.com/glec.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Order the Reference Books</a></li></ul>"}, "elements": []}]}]}]}]}, {"id": "71084df", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "boxed", "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"column": "40", "row": "40", "isLinked": true, "unit": "px", "size": 40}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "72", "right": "64", "bottom": "80", "left": "64", "isLinked": false}, "boxed_width": {"unit": "px", "size": 1312, "sizes": []}, "flex_gap_mobile": {"column": "28", "row": "28", "isLinked": true, "unit": "px", "size": 28}, "padding_tablet": {"unit": "px", "top": "80", "right": "40", "bottom": "80", "left": "40", "isLinked": false}, "padding_mobile": {"unit": "px", "top": "64", "right": "20", "bottom": "64", "left": "20", "isLinked": false}, "background_background": "classic", "__globals__": {"background_color": "globals/colors?id=mist"}, "html_tag": "section"}, "elements": [{"id": "06cb459", "elType": "container", "isInner": false, "settings": {"content_width": "full", "flex_direction": "column", "flex_gap": {"column": "14", "row": "14", "isLinked": true, "unit": "px", "size": 14}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "css_classes": "g-next"}, "elements": [{"id": "6c55c71", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "isInner": false, "settings": {"title": "Next step", "header_size": "div", "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=blue", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=eyebrow"}, "_css_classes": "g-eyebrow"}, "elements": []}, {"id": "6a91fe5", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "heading", "isInner": false, "settings": {"title": "Board application and meeting dates", "header_size": "h2", "__globals__": {"title_color": "globals/colors?id=navy", "typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=h2"}, "typography_typography": "custom", "typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 32, "sizes": []}, "typography_font_size_mobile": {"unit": "px", "size": 26, "sizes": []}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "89f0748", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "text-editor", "isInner": false, "settings": {"editor": "<p>Once you pass, check GOALS online to find your license number, and print your license from the Secretary of State website.</p>", "__globals__": {"typography_typography": "globals/typography?id=body", "text_color": "globals/colors?id=slate"}}, "elements": []}, {"id": "8b85bc3", "elType": "widget", "widgetType": "button", "isInner": false, "settings": {"